## Instructions: Build a React Carousel

![React Carousel](https://github.com/devtlv/studentsGitHub/blob/master/JS/Week%208/Day1/Daily%20Challenge/daily%20challenge.png?raw=true)

Check the [demo](http://di-react-carousel.surge.sh/).

1. Use the [React Responsive Carousel package](https://www.npmjs.com/package/react-responsive-carousel) to create the carousel.
2. In your `App` component, use the corresponding imports from the installed package.
